        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have the hindquarters of a cricket and shiny skin that appears chitinous, though it might be soft to the touch. You adore art and music. Your cricket legs grant you a +2 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to [[/act high-jump]] or [[/act long-jump]]. You also gain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Figment] as a primal innate cantrip, though you can use it only to create illusory sounds, not visions. A cantrip is heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.</p>"
